<speak>I'll note your contact preference. Let me cover the relevant points before we move on. Nova Technology Equity Fund is concentrated in technology shares, so its value can fall sharply when sentiment across that sector weakens. Your redemption proceeds can also change before the applicable valuation is determined. You could lose part or even all of the capital you invested in this fund. Do you understand the sector concentration risk and that the redemption proceeds may differ from what you expect?</speak>